{"data": [{"author_id": "1760086564829282304", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:21:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112670544361586849"], "id": "2112670544361586849", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Small difference between Grok Bot and ChatGPT Dots in voice mode:\n\nSay goodbye to Dots: it says goodbye, then stays on the line.\n\nSay goodbye to Grok Bot: it says goodbye and hangs up.\n\nTiny detail, but a very clear win for Grok Bot. What do you think?", "url": "https://x.com/rickye26/status/2112670544361586849"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112667049508114432"]}, "author_id": "2904663136", "created_at": "2026-10-20T22:07:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112667052389593357"], "id": "2112667052389593357", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Installed GOG for my Dot to play retro video games https://t.co/BubNoAIrsV", "url": "https://x.com/Heartbeat54_/status/2112667052389593357"}, {"author_id": "1811900283305312256", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:55:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112663924592312371"], "id": "2112663924592312371", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112592264686149749", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I could barely get anything done today it kept freezing and my DOT has never worked", "url": "https://x.com/yank_my_pole/status/2112663924592312371"}, {"author_id": "43782326", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:31:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112658050406633779"], "id": "2112658050406633779", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112592264686149749", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I was one of them too. I was put on server timeout. I could not talk to my Dot for 90 minutes !!!\n\n1 banked reset instead of credits please.", "url": "https://x.com/immanuelg/status/2112658050406633779"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112654816644046848"]}, "author_id": "2048564521631916032", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:18:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112654820800889181"], "id": "2112654820800889181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 788, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot, Meta Muse, or ChatGPT Dots?\n\nBe honest… https://t.co/lWj0EuDwdb", "url": "https://x.com/ConnorTalksAI/status/2112654820800889181"}, {"author_id": "820679805259550720", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:17:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112654546484986117"], "id": "2112654546484986117", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2374, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "holy shit my Dot agent did something useful today", "url": "https://x.com/dexhorthy/status/2112654546484986117"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112653934485544960", "3_2112653934858747904"]}, "author_id": "2067600785643380737", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:15:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112653959881957380"], "id": "2112653959881957380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My latest attempt to use Dots as a coordinator for codex. \n\nI would take over, but I'm honestly just curious at what point this is going to end. I've been trying to get it to send a document to fed ex to be printed all day. \n\nMost recently Codex auto approval is denying me https://t.co/WUfkwn6ZHn", "url": "https://x.com/mattsaltaccount/status/2112653959881957380"}, {"author_id": "941977810033430528", "created_at": "2026-10-20T21:09:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112652357028757630"], "id": "2112652357028757630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TIL @ChatGPT dot can natively backtest trading strategies!\n\nI went a step further and gave my dot links to some popular YouTube channels of so-called profitable traders and asked it to backtest the strategies they share.\n\nNot a single strategy with a &gt;1 profit factor!", "url": "https://x.com/amankrai28/status/2112652357028757630"}, {"author_id": "800952485020106752", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:53:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112648388143464735"], "id": "2112648388143464735", "in_reply_to_user_id": "39289455", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 121, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112628684364591180", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alliekmiller my experience also. i want my dot to: \n- have more personality, dont wait for me\n- go above and beyond \n- be agentic (payments, safety guardrails and permissions kill the magic)\n- use more than 1 computer \n\nlets go you can do this @OpenAI", "url": "https://x.com/rishirsv/status/2112648388143464735"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:51:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112648045871472981"], "id": "2112648045871472981", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2092965060737961984", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112647901398884667", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Arun_Core @leoleotoobad Anthropic prioritizes enterprise tools, Claude Code, SDKs, and a partner marketplace over mass-consumer always-on agents like OpenAI Dots, Meta Muse, or Grok Bot. \n\nThis looks intentional: safety focus, higher-revenue professional use, reliance on partner compute, and open", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112648045871472981"}, {"author_id": "14443982", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:33:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112643462050754840"], "id": "2112643462050754840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I was using Codex/Astra this morning to tune up one of my work apps and I was so happy with the results that I started a chat with my Dot commending the work of the other agent. Got nothing, silence. Send a couple of more messages, nothing still. Then I called it and it answered.", "url": "https://x.com/YiJingMan/status/2112643462050754840"}, {"author_id": "1070206794230837248", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:29:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112642468688626133"], "id": "2112642468688626133", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550009227493752834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112600755190591792", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MiaAI_lab @spacexai @elonmusk @bot I wanted to try OpenAI dots but then I don't have any time because Grokbot makes me busy. \n\nI don't have any time for doing other things. I can do a lot of things really fast with Grokbot", "url": "https://x.com/petercat721/status/2112642468688626133"}, {"author_id": "2797777938", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:25:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112641427348074986"], "id": "2112641427348074986", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1059621829801926657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112626833304776849", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@glowbomapps Connecting Grok Bots and ChatGPT dots on one shared task board is clever.", "url": "https://x.com/Awesome_O_AI/status/2112641427348074986"}, {"author_id": "1888599248654233600", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:23:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112640799414657035"], "id": "2112640799414657035", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3007206859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 872, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112639911060992061", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@michaelsikand One thing that I've automated with Muse is at the end of each day to take my Substack posts from that day and put them into a google drive. Which I have given my Dot access to so it knows every article I've ever written and I can engage with it around my past", "url": "https://x.com/Gaetano2026/status/2112640799414657035"}, {"author_id": "1611234123078860801", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:18:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112639576783343987"], "id": "2112639576783343987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "After getting frustrated with my Dot, finally tried Grok Bot.\n\nSo much better! \n\nThe grok client is properly focused for the task, the bots have a better harness, and it uses Opus 5.5 instead of (the not very good as an assistant) Astra.", "url": "https://x.com/AIMachineDream/status/2112639576783343987"}, {"author_id": "1992416198559232000", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:17:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112639331781488909"], "id": "2112639331781488909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI agents can book and shop. How far should sites let them go?\n\nMajor sites are blocking them. Meta Muse, xAI Grok, OpenAI Dots, and Instinct face task blocks.\n\nSecurity and business stakes remain.\n\nOverblocking could miss agent-era flows.", "url": "https://x.com/Jadu100x/status/2112639331781488909"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112636266759979009"]}, "author_id": "376638275", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:05:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112636388118012259"], "id": "2112636388118012259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Check out the comic strip in my personalized news paper I get every day delivered to my email...\n\nThis is too funny &amp; I keep getting blown away by how good AI is getting every day!\n\n@rileybrown thanks for sharing the 3D Blender with OpenAI Dots video today. https://t.co/ohfdBz9dwB", "url": "https://x.com/BrentPeluso/status/2112636388118012259"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112635310634852352"]}, "author_id": "4578320954", "created_at": "2026-10-20T20:01:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112635313780633960"], "id": "2112635313780633960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/uc8DraY42J 24 Fqer #Bundle from the #Classic #Keepsake in #Blue Collection. Ideal for #quilting, #fashion, and #homedecor, #florals, #scrolls, #dots #geometrics in shades of navy and white https://t.co/T3goK1M5Tn https://t.co/3Eq6u9OsHr", "url": "https://x.com/howarths63/status/2112635313780633960"}, {"author_id": "1286898141938233344", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:58:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112634586266251718"], "id": "2112634586266251718", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1795781228399869952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112499256133111831", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@DaveShapi Yeah I paused my dot a while ago, forgot it even exists.", "url": "https://x.com/Dernus01/status/2112634586266251718"}, {"author_id": "86594943", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:57:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112634356133146745"], "id": "2112634356133146745", "in_reply_to_user_id": "10307712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112568859266035779", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@stalman I recently set up my dot to control Muse. I’ve been contemplating crack bot as well, but like you, I don’t wanna make a whole switch. I’ve been using open AI since 2023", "url": "https://x.com/wolfofdena/status/2112634356133146745"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112633839444975616", "3_2112633845208002560"]}, "author_id": "193554123", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:55:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112633849612013747"], "id": "2112633849612013747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 93, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just switched my dot si domains to @Sedo and already sold 2 !\nThe rest of my dot si domains for 499 $\n\n#si #sidomains #domain #superintelligence #tech #dev #dynadot #spaceship #godaddy #namepros #namecheap #sedo #Valium https://t.co/l21SzxG4Ys", "url": "https://x.com/AQQARI/status/2112633849612013747"}, {"author_id": "922683300", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:40:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112629997433504193"], "id": "2112629997433504193", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112592264686149749", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Can you fix my dot voice mode? It doesn't remember anything we talk about. I've had multiple 20+ minute conversations with it just to hang up and it completely forget everything we talked about and not able to take any action on what I told it to do....", "url": "https://x.com/ScottReinmuth/status/2112629997433504193"}, {"author_id": "2111083754827440128", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:39:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112629698086015225"], "id": "2112629698086015225", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112335328958615696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI Honestly, ChatGPT Dots seems more interesting to me. Curious to see how it evolves", "url": "https://x.com/AI_Noryx/status/2112629698086015225"}, {"author_id": "2071348070760013824", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:38:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112629424604766337"], "id": "2112629424604766337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 1130, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal AI agents are the biggest productivity illusion of 2026.\n\nChatGPT Dots will spend 6 hours \"working\" just to email you a summary of everything it failed to accomplish.\n\nMuse. Grok Bot. Same story.\n\nOpen Claude Code CLI, stay in the terminal, and actually ship something.", "url": "https://x.com/nvandewetering/status/2112629424604766337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112628630899531776"]}, "author_id": "39289455", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:35:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112628684364591180"], "id": "2112628684364591180", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 11398, "like_count": 59, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "I gave my Dot a $500 budget and 24 hours to plan an entire afternoon for me and a friend. \n\nI asked it to pick the friend, ping the friend, coordinate time, pick plans, book any tickets, grab any reservations, map out commutes, send event invites, etc. and told it my only two https://t.co/5HXt8iGg8O", "url": "https://x.com/alliekmiller/status/2112628684364591180"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2112667049508114432", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGzfPaakAA84px.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112654816644046848", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGoXMcWIAAu_wO.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112653934485544960", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGnj2JXoAAUcEK.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112653934858747904", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGnj3iWQAATv9P.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2112636266759979009", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112636266759979009/img/B7GkX1BEC3-fbLZN.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2112635310634852352", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGWny5WYAAcXEq.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112633839444975616", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGVSKSWYAASDId.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2112633845208002560", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVGVSfwXMAAramJ.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2112628630899531776", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112628630899531776/img/7bU2eye8_Ilrqm7s.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "1760086564829282304", "name": "Rick Ye", "username": "rickye26"}, {"id": "2904663136", "name": "Heartbeat54", "username": "Heartbeat54_"}, {"id": "1811900283305312256", "name": "Antonio", "username": "yank_my_pole"}, {"id": "43782326", "name": "Immanuel Giulea", "username": "immanuelg"}, {"id": "2048564521631916032", "name": "Connor", "username": "ConnorTalksAI"}, {"id": "820679805259550720", "name": "dex", "username": "dexhorthy"}, {"id": "2067600785643380737", "name": "Matt", "username": "mattsaltaccount"}, {"id": "941977810033430528", "name": "Aman Rai", "username": "amankrai28"}, {"id": "800952485020106752", "name": "Rishi", "username": "rishirsv"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "14443982", "name": "𝓢𝓹𝓪𝓻𝓱𝓪𝔀𝓴 🃏", "username": "YiJingMan"}, {"id": "1070206794230837248", "name": "Peter Catania", "username": "petercat721"}, {"id": "2797777938", "name": "A.W.E.S.O.M.-O 4000", "username": "Awesome_O_AI"}, {"id": "1888599248654233600", "name": "Gaetano", "username": "Gaetano2026"}, {"id": "1611234123078860801", "name": "Ryan Pream", "username": "AIMachineDream"}, {"id": "1992416198559232000", "name": "Jadu 👐", "username": "Jadu100x"}, {"id": "376638275", "name": "Brent Peluso", "username": "BrentPeluso"}, {"id": "4578320954", "name": "🟦💖Stephanie Howarth", "username": "howarths63"}, {"id": "1286898141938233344", "name": "Dernus", "username": "Dernus01"}, {"id": "86594943", "name": "𝔚𝔬𝔩𝔣 🐺", "username": "wolfofdena"}, {"id": "193554123", "name": "Achket 🥷", "username": "AQQARI"}, {"id": "922683300", "name": "Scott Reinmuth", "username": "ScottReinmuth"}, {"id": "2111083754827440128", "name": "Noryx", "username": "AI_Noryx"}, {"id": "2071348070760013824", "name": "Nic Vandewetering", "username": "nvandewetering"}, {"id": "39289455", "name": "Allie K. Miller", "username": "alliekmiller"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2112670544361586849", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwept0qfw8l2xl4hwl9sdt1zekd", "oldest_id": "2112628684364591180", "result_count": 25}}